1. What DueCare distributes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DueCare does NOT redistribute Gemma 4 base model weights. Wherever Gemma is
used, the weights are obtained by the operator directly from Google's own
distribution channels (the Kaggle `google/gemma-4` model listing or the
corresponding Hugging Face repositories).

DueCare DOES distribute Derivative Works of Gemma 4 in one place: LoRA adapter
weights produced by fine-tuning, published as

    kaggle.com/datasets/taylorsamarel/duecare-gemma4-adapter-learning-study
    (runs/run-01/adapter/, runs/run-02/adapter/)

Those adapters are low-rank deltas. They are inert without Gemma 4 base weights
and are Derivative Works within the meaning of the Apache License 2.0.

