2. Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, Section 4b)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No file supplied by Google is modified or redistributed by this project. The
adapters named above are new files produced by parameter-efficient fine-tuning
(LoRA) of Gemma 4; they add low-rank weight deltas and replace nothing.

Each adapter ships with configuration recording its base checkpoint, rank, and
training procedure, so any recipient can see exactly what was derived and how.
Training data provenance and evaluation results ship in the same dataset.

